codex
The aggregator will score only completed manifest records and raw output files, strip the runner’s fixed EOF trailer, and keep two distinct measures: code-only compliance and normalized correctness. It will emit Wilson intervals, shared-family amount comparisons, paired position changes, matched filler comparisons, and the exact full/pruned pairing, avoiding the known sparse-tier composition confound.
